{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>「醫生，我耳朵裏是不是進了什麼東西？這兩天總覺得癢，還有點悶。」</p><p>近日，29歲的小李（化名）來到浙江省中西醫結合醫院（杭州市紅十字會醫院）耳鼻咽喉科診室，一坐下來就神色慌張。</p><p>她說，自己前幾天剛在某採耳店享受了一次「深度清潔」，當時感覺特別舒爽，甚至有點「上癮」。可回家後沒幾天，耳朵就開始不對勁：抓心般瘙癢、悶脹難忍，於是趕緊來到醫院就診。</p><figure><img alt=\"黏附在鼓膜表面的「羽毛」（微信公眾號@杭州市紅十字會醫院）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261021/1189547858232086528074653.jpeg/ydetfQx_GLDKL6SLfE5tT7PGHSeT-Zq5l6z8kpes_JI\"/><figcaption>黏附在鼓膜表面的「羽毛」（微信公眾號@杭州市紅十字會醫院）</figcaption></figure><p>接診的謝菲主治醫師用耳內鏡一看，發現靠近鼓膜的位置，貼着一圈淺色、細細軟軟的纖維，遠看像鼓膜邊緣「長出了一圈羽毛」。</p><p>仔細辨認後，罪魁禍首找到了：這不是耳朵裏長東西，而是採耳時使用的羽毛材料脱落，細小羽枝掉進外耳道，部分貼在鼓膜表面和周圍。謝醫生經過仔細操作，輕柔地取出了這根羽毛。</p><figure><img alt=\"取出來的羽毛（微信公眾號@杭州市紅十字會醫院）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261021/1189548001681477632392510.jpeg/jgA4ipSf3-CqUKHOwwnLEav5PSatnOa2SakotEmpKLQ\"/><figcaption>取出來的羽毛（微信公眾號@杭州市紅十字會醫院）</figcaption></figure><p>採耳時「酥酥麻麻」，羽毛怎麼就跑進耳朵深處了？</p><p>採耳店使用的工具，通常包括各種形狀的羽毛刷、鵝毛棒等，通過輕微的震動和觸感帶來「酥麻」的快感。然而，柔軟並不等於安全。</p><p>像羽毛這類柔軟的異物，一旦落入耳道裏，很容易「黏着」在裏面，誘發健康隱患。</p><figure><img alt=\"耳道裏的棉球（微信公眾號@杭州市紅十字會醫院）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261021/1189552334980517888097185.jpeg/MDPuXqjmkn2uTQ42QNGuoux_7I6U4wGLhJ91joSfdY4\"/><figcaption>耳道裏的棉球（微信公眾號@杭州市紅十字會醫院）</figcaption></figure><p>謝菲醫生介紹，臨床上經常見到因隨意掏耳朵引發耳道真菌感染的患者。不少人習慣使用沒有充分消毒的工具深挖耳道，耳道本身温暖潮濕，一旦皮膚受損，就很適合真菌繁殖。</p><p>還有患者掏耳後，棉花球這類異物遺留在耳道深處。殘留異物會造成耳悶、耳痛，還會繼發炎症。情況嚴重時，若掏耳用力過大、操作不當，甚至會造成鼓膜穿孔。</p><p>相關文章：耳朵癢｜耳屎過多會刺激外耳道神經引起痕癢？解構5種耳朵癢原因👇👇👇</p><figure><img alt=\"5種耳朵癢原因（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20211124/540188955610451968968423.jpeg/p3nJduVMVOw3bkb_PWC_Z0LTGbsFzLnd13RWetd0Vno\"/><figcaption>5種耳朵癢原因（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"5種耳朵癢原因（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20211124/540188957804204032847615.jpeg/mJbG-jrwvKFSZmY-S2A0oJepm8lv61OX95bOzPeWzsw\"/><figcaption>5種耳朵癢原因（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"5種耳朵癢原因（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20211124/540188960375443456013485.jpeg/va2dD30JuqcS6O-oQjmH-hbRMy8i75AXz1YQnM9WEJw\"/><figcaption>5種耳朵癢原因（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"5種耳朵癢原因（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20211124/540188963076706304984573.jpeg/6-SVQpToKqKv4JF6Y8VUH7yoo5KWKWtEv-rtN7_q7Tc\"/><figcaption>5種耳朵癢原因（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"5種耳朵癢原因（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20211124/540188965501145088134695.jpeg/Uagf4gdCP38JR4ONsHuMkhHEjrUE3HM3gl6BNYJegTU\"/><figcaption>5種耳朵癢原因（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"5種耳朵癢原因（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20211124/540188967661342720627803.jpeg/PajgX1EvA3-GnvkIfhDQpmD4kmIKk7mkis-Vs4rPlbM\"/><figcaption>5種耳朵癢原因（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"5種耳朵癢原因（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20211124/540188972434591744065713.jpeg/rNJwm2vZ5VVSf78FAyTrjbn3fisfcrWA8CTZlPAk2ZQ\"/><figcaption>5種耳朵癢原因（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"5種耳朵癢原因（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20211124/540188975215546368859027.jpeg/tNLPZtXbd_NW5Q_BRVUrsEDqCEKnsHk-bTjTOm040zo\"/><figcaption>5種耳朵癢原因（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"5種耳朵癢原因（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20211124/540188977560293376029683.jpeg/8ax9sLlz4ZplMnfmzvEvcaQAndEsvOXSH5M_uR-TP7k\"/><figcaption>5種耳朵癢原因（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"5種耳朵癢原因（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20211124/540188979485609984874953.jpeg/IRXtVnxrWBg7_ZUjVBjaltuBf-4DQyZdculkLXLpZC0\"/><figcaption>5種耳朵癢原因（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"5種耳朵癢原因（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20211124/540188954155028480326950.jpeg/2vCsuOJGdaqGeKFhpHdOJ9EdftW9MjmDQ-G95kPhveY\"/><figcaption>5種耳朵癢原因（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"5種耳朵癢原因（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20211124/540188956407500800176204.jpeg/uVA9pfsVjqn8nxgNoVymkE4E3WW_jr4HR1UH2UdVB9k\"/><figcaption>5種耳朵癢原因（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"5種耳朵癢原因（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20211124/540188958836133888985712.jpeg/glMaYpVz7XJvpar1SkSlhoJbOQniBZ_1e_0x_Xv9Mf0\"/><figcaption>5種耳朵癢原因（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><p>耳朵真不是越乾淨越好！</p><p>其實大部分人不用特意掏耳朵，耳朵本身具備自潔功能。耳屎的醫學名稱是耵聹，它並非污垢，是外耳道腺體分泌物、皮脂與脱落皮屑混合形成的。耵聹可以潤滑、濕潤耳道，吸附灰塵和細小異物，起到保護耳道的效果。</p><p>依靠耳道皮膚自然移動，再加上咀嚼、說話時下頜的活動，耵聹會慢慢移到耳道口，自行脱落。如果隨意掏耳朵，特別是用棉籤、挖耳勺深入耳道內部，容易損傷耳道皮膚，還會將耵聹推到耳道深處，堆積壓緊形成耵聹栓塞，增加後續清理的難度。</p><p>如何保護耳朵？記住3點</p><p>1. 平時只需用毛巾或棉籤輕輕擦拭外耳道口即可，切勿將任何工具伸入耳道深處，避免把棉籤、耳勺、髮夾伸進耳道。它們常常會把耳垢推得更深，還可能擦傷耳道或碰到鼓膜。</p><p>2. 一旦出現耳癢、耳痛、耳鳴、聽力下降或流膿等症狀，應立即前往正規醫院耳鼻喉科就診，由專業醫生進行診斷和處理。</p><p>3. 如果確實需要清理耳屎，請選擇正規醫療機構。</p><p>相關文章：【耳屎】抗菌促代謝滋潤耳朵　別撩耳屎3原因免中耳炎愈撩愈多 👇👇👇</p><figure><img alt=\"耳垢4大作用（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201208/413021279575085056932658.jpeg/8y6JEQkeTiaSkevZ-ofPfb7S5BPm421ZaUy512lMudc\"/><figcaption>耳垢4大作用（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"耳垢4大作用（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201208/413021281970163712561932.jpeg/9nPFRX4W5jQkBZRJH9s8UbIrKyNJ0aLryuG948rhveM\"/><figcaption>耳垢4大作用（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"耳垢4大作用（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201208/413021284159721472015483.jpeg/x9Ll7roeOpvd1laqYsSdZavhonQLOX73iCxJyogsSco\"/><figcaption>耳垢4大作用（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"耳垢4大作用（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201208/413021286689017856374210.jpeg/nXQTBRJJ2rgvveE07ibV8_gI593zLcSxuatrFbmraxU\"/><figcaption>耳垢4大作用（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"耳垢4大作用（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201208/413021288966656000502394.jpeg/aRgyNRSm37lpVhVH8DiaIYdvpruvtGkeSGxXuEhsV7g\"/><figcaption>耳垢4大作用（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"耳垢4大作用（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201208/413021291235905536782493.jpeg/6-uvKArLA-D9KpdXqXj-sZJrPMQ_CrOt1laRU9ZWkVM\"/><figcaption>耳垢4大作用（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"耳垢4大作用（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201208/413021293479989248301425.jpeg/6m5u-eLGyAhl9yub6mWDzmZF8xf7bAUtw3kCF8N5Ahc\"/><figcaption>耳垢4大作用（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"耳垢4大作用（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201208/413021295984119808931462.jpeg/VEHeuZkM4eEYpjVOF03eTAMnsQEDLrbqDrRoZQ60aGU\"/><figcaption>耳垢4大作用（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"耳垢4大作用（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201208/413021298790240256123408.jpeg/cXVC4PoQN_45I4yATtifvR5826Yz0DFKgg7xuoIO8bo\"/><figcaption>耳垢4大作用（01製圖）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T05:21:50.399723+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1437,"images":25,"source":"HK01 中國","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T05:00:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T05:57:48.142387+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T05:17:40.562933+00:00","content_hash":"cbbf0151b2042f5370ac5941bc371a39d22a63b23ec9f2b897d82b70c4290603","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}